WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.850 --> 00:00:07.554
Open "Seal" in the project.

2
00:00:08.054 --> 00:00:13.759
Tap "Seal the report now".

3
00:00:14.259 --> 00:00:19.971
Only a digital fingerprint is sent to the notary service.

4
00:00:20.471 --> 00:00:26.180
Share the link with your client.

5
00:00:26.680 --> 00:00:34.471
On the proof page, the client checks the file without an account.

6
00:00:34.921 --> 00:00:40.629
It proves the report existed in this form, not that the measurements are correct.

